<title>POLAND: Polish grain prices mixed in Nov, livestock falls.</title>
<headline>Polish grain prices mixed in Nov, livestock falls.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish procurement wheat, cattle and pork prices fell in November, while rye and milk prices rose against October, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Thursday.</p>
<p> POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES	   NOVEMBER  OCTOBER  NOVEMBER 95</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		58.50     59.01    39.74</p>
<p>   month/month pct change	    -0.9	 2.9	9.2</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change		    47.2	62.1     37.9 @</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		40.44     39.24    24.16</p>
<p>   month/month pct change	     3.1	 6.2	6.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change		    67.4	73.7     27.2</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg		     2.57	2.60     2.55</p>
<p>   month/month pct change	    -1.2	-2.2     -2.2</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change		     0.9	-0.2     37.8</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg		     3.47	3.60     2.62</p>
<p>   month/month pct change	    -3.7	-5.8     -3.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change		    32.4	32.2     -5.6 @</p>
<p>MILK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per litre		  0.54	0.53     0.49</p>
<p>   month/month pct change	     3.0	 3.4	3.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change		    10.7	11.6     46.5</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
